{"data": [{"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:50:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115380704859292124"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XICf8YJF5X", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2115380704859292124/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115380685703966720", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/XICf8YJF5X"}]}, "id": "2115380704859292124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "凌晨2点美联储公布利率决议\n市场走势必将再起波澜\n中期选举临近不确定因素叠加\n本周迎来美股本轮财报季\n10月操盘手训练营开班进行中\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/XICf8YJF5X", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2115380704859292124"}, {"author_id": "1688764204394942464", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:25:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115646071539937547"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pKzGyQMQxF", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jam91613/status/2115646071539937547/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115644927107317760", "start": 102, "url": "https://t.co/pKzGyQMQxF"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pKzGyQMQxF", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jam91613/status/2115646071539937547/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115644960204619776", "start": 102, "url": "https://t.co/pKzGyQMQxF"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pKzGyQMQxF", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jam91613/status/2115646071539937547/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115645019830845440", "start": 102, "url": "https://t.co/pKzGyQMQxF"}]}, "id": "2115646071539937547", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2184, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中山三院泌尿外科张子禄大夫,婚内长达六载红杏出墙,\n\n忽悠女大学生又虐又撩,女方愤而千字檄文全网曝光！\n\n原文如下：\n\n震惊！无奈！忍无可忍！\n\n6月1号发现你n段出轨史，直至8月我都出于心软没有检举。 https://t.co/pKzGyQMQxF", "url": "https://x.com/jam91613/status/2115646071539937547"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:27:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115688830301007993", "2115692083684188470"], "id": "2115692083684188470", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1488, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "以下为缠中说禅原文摘录，仅供学习参考。\n\n缠中说禅在《下一目标：摧毁基金》中，对基金使用了一系列带有强烈贬义和隐喻色彩的“命名”。这些称呼集中体现了他对基金结构性缺陷的判断。\n\n核心命名与含义\n“合法传销”", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2115692083684188470"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:14:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115688830301007993", "2115692083684188470"], "id": "2115688830301007993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "注意以下内容源自缠师，并非本人所写，因此本人不承担任何责任，也请勿对号入座。\n\n缠中说禅在《下一目标：摧毁基金》中，对基金使用了一系列带有强烈贬义和隐喻色彩的“命名”。这些称呼集中体现了他对基金结构性缺陷的判断。\n\n核心命名与含义\n“合法传销”", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2115688830301007993"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:24:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115449577679835315"], "id": "2115449577679835315", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 7295, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "缠中说禅看险资高位接盘：一条自称耐心的巨鲸，两个月就翻了白肚皮\n\n有人问：险资7月高位买科技股，9月割肉，怎么看？\n\n本ID只回一句：\n这叫什么？这叫把大米装到自己肚里。\n\n市场从来就没有什么\"耐心资本\"，只有当下的合力。\n你喊着长钱长投，\n盘面上却在最高段去接别人的抛盘，", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2115449577679835315"}, {"author_id": "2096056678022311936", "created_at": "2026-10-28T23:15:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115583252715192412"], "id": "2115583252715192412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 1401, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "让你醍醐灌顶的一句话\n\n1、《金瓶梅》中李瓶儿跟潘金莲聊天时说：“莲妹妹，记住姐一包话，这世上的事儿，凡是禁止的，往往是有好处但不想分给你。凡是提倡的，大概率是有坑需要你去填。“瓶儿的一句话，让金莲醍醐灌顶。", "url": "https://x.com/Q9925912/status/2115583252715192412"}, {"author_id": "295762239", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:55:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789633464438801"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_t5Cf5Khy3gn9A1?pwd=jycp", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_t5Cf5Khy3gn9A1?pwd=jycp", "url": "https://t.co/nFAFg9JPXw"}]}, "id": "2115789633464438801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 24508, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/nFAFg9JPXw\n\n《百分之五》作者：一颗松果\n《变成垂耳兔后》作者：不动茗\n《倒刺》作者：悖妄\n《福无双至》作者：墨衣绣骨\n《假面佛》作者：陌上南疆\n《渴望降生》作者：西露比sylvie\n《模特》作者：MeAtfish\n《失业小朋友》作者：作者名无所不能", "url": "https://x.com/jason_gurung/status/2115789633464438801"}, {"author_id": "1870321256631066624", "created_at": "2026-10-28T03:34:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115286011660144939"], "id": "2115286011660144939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "拉屎堪比禅修，我每次拉屎的时候就文思泉涌，跟GPT疯狂沟通创意，难怪跟职场中年大哥一打电话对方就说我在拉屎等会儿回复你\n\n没创意了吗？Let's 拉屎", "url": "https://x.com/Birdy_web3/status/2115286011660144939"}, {"author_id": "995771442523459587", "created_at": "2026-10-29T19:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115881506505699620"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zhangdajun/sta…", "end": 132, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zhangdajun/status/2115831902468768049", "start": 109, "url": "https://t.co/uGNjAAUNpO"}]}, "id": "2115881506505699620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 127, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115831902468768049", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "康德说：自由的前提是自律。这话算是有见地了。\n在中国思想体系中，追求自由主义思想的有两派：一是禅宗的临济宗；二是道家思想。\n可是同样在中国的思想体系里，禅宗的天然对头就是律宗，用戒律把禅宗压的死死的不让他们堕入狂禅。 https://t.co/uGNjAAUNpO", "url": "https://x.com/daoge2018/status/2115881506505699620"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-10-28T02:14:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115265856884330519"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 50, "start": 46, "tag": "btc"}, {"end": 55, "start": 51, "tag": "eth"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Cr12gZGbv7", "end": 79, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2115265856884330519/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115265643985666048", "start": 56, "url": "https://t.co/Cr12gZGbv7"}]}, "id": "2115265856884330519", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论爱好者的天堂，未来发布，各种金融市场标的的缠论分析图，绝对的专业到位，欢迎大家一起聊聊 #btc #eth https://t.co/Cr12gZGbv7", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2115265856884330519"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:33:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115633190484553764"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 57, "id": "10228272", "start": 49, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠论交易系统教学多年-专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作-周一至周五早8点缠论解析早课-每周...", "display_url": "youtu.be/rE2Sd9P8FlU?si…", "end": 45, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/rE2Sd9P8FlU?si=RGIByRqpjPIeoI1v", "images": [{"height": 360, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115633195450572800/ag4fZlNt?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 480}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115633195450572800/ag4fZlNt?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 22, "status": 200, "title": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.29", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=RGIByRqpjPIeoI1v&v=rE2Sd9P8FlU&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/8z2heNOoUW"}]}, "id": "2115633190484553764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》